# Golbez, Crystal Collector: "Whenever an artifact you control enters, surveil 1." and "At the beginning of your end step, if you control four or more artifacts, return target creature card from
# your graveyard to your hand. Then if you control eight or more artifacts, each opponent loses life equal to that card's power." Turn 1 Bot1 casts Golbez, then five more artifacts (the Moxen and a Black
# Lotus; the first three entered before it and surveil nothing, the other three do): the first surveil puts a Savannah Lions in the graveyard, the rest keep the Memnite on top. Six artifacts at the end step:
# the Lions come back to hand and Bot2 loses nothing. Turn 3 the Memnite is drawn and cast (seven artifacts; its surveil puts Hill Giant in the graveyard, which returns at the end step, still no loss).
# Turn 5 the Ornithopter is the eighth artifact; its surveil puts a second Hill Giant in the graveyard, and at the end step it returns and Bot2 loses 3, the card's power.

